      "connection_topology": {
        "component_connections": "CAN_Interface P-PORT连接IF_Can_Command到Light_Controller R-PORT；Light_Controller P-PORT连接IF_PWM_Control到PWM_Generator R-PORT；PWM_Generator P-PORT连接IF_PWM_Feedback到Light_Controller R-PORT；Light_Controller P-PORT连接IF_Can_Status到CAN_Interface R-PORT；两者均通过PR-PORT访问IF_Light_Params。",
        "data_flow_paths": "CAN_Interface→Light_Controller: 指令与亮度设定；Light_Controller→PWM_Generator: 各路占空比设定；PWM_Generator→Light_Controller: 亮度反馈与故障；Light_Controller→CAN_Interface: 状态与故障上报。",
        "control_flow_paths": "定时器驱动CAN_Interface(5ms)、Light_Controller(10ms)、PWM_Generator(1ms)；事件驱动为指令到达与反馈更新触发各自处理Runnable。"
      },
